+### Provenance research and unresolved admission choices
+
+Primary sources checked on 2 November 2026: [npm's attestation distinction and safety limitation](https://docs.npmjs.com/generating-provenance-statements/), [SLSA v1.2 verification expectations](https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/verifying-artifacts) and [versioned build predicate](https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-provenance). npm distinguishes registry publish attestations from build provenance. SLSA calls for signature/subject checks plus expected build/source parameters and a trust configuration; its predicate's presence is not a generic SLSA-level pass rule. This plan proposes application policy checks rather than claiming a builder level or artifact safety.
