+| Completed bounded discovery establishes no usable required assertion in the captured scope | `absent` / `not_available` | Required-and-absence-is-violation: 1; optional-and-explicitly-permitted: pass/0 with provenance still absent. Missing advertisement alone is not cryptographically proven global absence. |
